      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SOHO SPARKLE (2) has been freshened since the Vicbred Super Series where she placed in both the heats and semis before drawing wide and working in the final. Much better placed at this level and draws to advantage. MYDEEPESTDESIRE (6) has begun her career in a promising manner with minor placings at all four starts. Ran another honest race last time at Melton and she came from wider than this in her previous two outings including a nose second at Maryborough two back. Big chance to break the maiden status. QUICK CRUNCH (5) draws wider but must be respected after scoring last start by close to 8 metres at Cranbourne. MIDNIGHT MOJO (3) has been about the mark of late and can feature again having come from wider for a sound third at Melton last week.",
